<setup>

  <selectFromSequence name="a" from="-2.5" to="2.5" step="1" exclude="0"/>
  <selectFromSequence name="b" from="1.2" to="4.2" step="1"/>

  <math name="ABSb"><abs>$b</abs></math>

  <function name="r" symbolic="false">-$a/(x^2 + 1)</function>
  <derivative name="rP" symbolic="false">$r</derivative>
  <function name="s" symbolic="false">0.25*$b*cos(x/($a^2+1))</function>
  <derivative name="sP" symbolic="false">$s</derivative>

</setup>


  <p>Let <m>r</m> and <m>s</m> be functions; some of their values are given by the following table.</p>
   <!--  <p>Note that <m>a = $a</m> and <m>b = $b</m>. </p> -->

      <tabular bottom="minor" top="minor">
        <row bottom="minor">
          <cell><m>x</m></cell>
          <cell><math>$a</math></cell>
          <cell><math simplify>$a+0.25*$ABSb</math></cell>
          <cell><math simplify>$a+0.5*$ABSb</math></cell>
          <cell><math simplify>$a+0.75*$ABSb</math></cell>
          <cell><math simplify>$a+1*$ABSb</math></cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell><m>r(x)</m></cell>
          <cell><math name="r1" displayDecimals="4">$$r($a)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="r2" displayDecimals="4">$$r($a+0.25*$ABSb)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="r3" displayDecimals="4">$$r($a+0.5*$ABSb)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="r4" displayDecimals="4">$$r($a+0.75*$ABSb)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="r5" displayDecimals="4">$$r($a+$ABSb)</math></cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell><m>s(x)</m></cell>
          <cell><math name="s1" displayDecimals="4">$$s($a)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="s2" displayDecimals="4">$$s($a+0.25*$ABSb)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="s3" displayDecimals="4">$$s($a+0.5*$ABSb)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="s4" displayDecimals="4">$$s($a+0.75*$ABSb)</math></cell>
          <cell><math name="s5" displayDecimals="4">$$s($a+$ABSb)</math></cell>
        </row>
      </tabular>

<!--   <p>Note that <m>r(x) = <math>$r</math> </m>, <m>r'(x) = <math> $rP</math></m>, <m>s(x) = <math>$s</math></m>, <m>s'(x) = <math>$sP</math></m>.</p> -->

   <p>Use central differences appropriately to generate the best estimate you can for each of the following values of <m>r'(x)</m> and <m>s'(x)</m>. </p>
   <ol marker="a.">
    <li>
      <p>
      <setup>
        <math simplify name="d3">($r3-$r1)/(0.5*$ABSb) </math>
      </setup>
        <answer><mathInput name="ans1"><label><m>r'(<math simplify>$a+0.25*$ABSb</math>) \approx </m></label></mathInput>
          <award allowedErrorInNumbers="0.001" allowedErrorIsAbsolute>
            <when>
              $ans1 = $d3 <!-- or $ans1 = $d1 or $ans1 = $d2 -->
            </when>
          </award>
        </answer>
        <!--
        <math> ($$r($a+0.5*$ABSb)-$$r($a + 0.25*$ABSb))/(0.25*$ABSb) , ($$r($a+0.25*$ABSb)-$$r(1*$a))/(0.25*$ABSb),  ($$r($a+0.5*$ABSb)-$$r($a))/(0.5*$ABSb) </math>
        -->
      </p>
    </li>

    <li>
      <p>
      <setup>
        <!-- <math simplify name="e1">($$s($a+1*$ABSb)-$$s($a + 0.75*$ABSb))/(0.25*$ABSb) </math>
        <math simplify name="e2">($$s($a+0.75*$ABSb)-$$s($a+0.5*$ABSb))/(0.25*$ABSb) </math>   -->
        <math simplify name="e3">($s5-$s3)/(0.5*$ABSb) </math>
      </setup>
        <answer><mathInput name="ans2"><label><m>s'(<math simplify>$a+0.75*$ABSb</math>) \approx </m></label></mathInput>
          <award allowedErrorInNumbers="0.001" allowedErrorIsAbsolute>
            <when>
              <!-- $ans2 = $e1 or $ans2 = $e2 or --> $ans2 = $e3
            </when>
          </award>
        </answer>
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
        <!--
        <math> ($$s($a+0.75*$ABSb)-$$s($a+0.5*$ABSb))/(0.25*$ABSb) </math>

        <math> ($$s($a+0.75*$ABSb)-$$s($a + 0.5*$ABSb))/(0.25*$ABSb),  ($$s($a+0.5*$ABSb)-$$s($a+0.25*$ABSb))/(0.25*$ABSb), ($$s($a+0.75*$ABSb)-$$s($a+0.25*$ABSb))/(0.5*$ABSb) </math>
        -->